    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 4 and takes about 2 hours 30 minutes start to finish, mostly hands-off oven time. The thing to watch is the initial browning: each piece of beef needs real colour before it goes into the pot or the final sauce will taste flat."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Dry the beef well with kitchen paper before browning. Wet beef steams rather than browns and you lose that deep crust that gives the sauce its body."
          }
        ]
      },
